{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1268791-chronicles-that-focus-on-the-dreaming","id":1268791,"title":"Chronicles that focus on the Dreaming?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-19T04:18:14-08:00","id":1268791,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Chronicles that focus on the Dreaming?","content":"I've read through my books, searching for any kind of represantation of the Dreaming in any of the chronicles described therein. I found nothing. Now, I do own Denizens of the Dreaming and Dreams and Nightmares, but besides some fluff texts there is no chronicle in them. So, WW never actually released a chronicle that even includes traveling to or through the Dreaming?<br /> <br /> I'm also searching for other sources, like Youtube, but honestly I don't have the time (or the tenacity) to watch through 2 hour long videos for the chance, something Dreaming related will happen. Does anyone know a good video where a motley enters the Dreaming? Is there something I've overlooked in the books?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-19T06:29:36-08:00","id":1268831,"title":"","content":"Dreams and Nightmares is the definitive sourcebook on the Dreaming. It's got all sorts of locations and plot-hooks throughout. It also has general notes about the near, far, and deep dreaming so you can create your own settings that fit in with whatever layer of the Dreaming your players find themselves in. There's no prewritten chronicle in it, but it gives you plenty of tools with which to create your own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-19T16:44:15-08:00","id":1269021,"title":"","content":"The best part of Changeling is that they *don't* limit the Dreaming. It can be varied and creative! It can represent pop culture, or faerie tales, or dreamscapes or whatever you like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2197-roleplayrose","name":"roleplayrose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2197_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}